%% Title: Feature workflow
%% Purpose: Show the primary product flow, decisions, and recovery paths.
%% Assumptions:
%% - Replace sample labels with project-specific language.
%% Open questions:
%% - Confirm which failure states are in scope.
flowchart TD
    Start([User starts task]) --> Input[Enter required details]
    Input --> Validate{Details valid?}
    Validate -- Yes --> Submit[Submit request]
    Validate -- No --> Fix[Show inline guidance]
    Fix --> Input
    Submit --> Process[System processes request]
    Process --> Success([Task complete])
    Process --> Error[Show recoverable error]
    Error --> Retry{Try again?}
    Retry -- Yes --> Submit
    Retry -- No --> Exit([Exit flow])
